uiet street opposite Rosengarten Park, you'll also be a 5-minute walk from Kehl Banhof Tram Stop, which takes you to Strasbourg city centre in 15 minutes.\n\nThe Kehl swimming pool is a 10-minute walk (Freibad), and the garden on both sides is a 7-minute walk.\n\n My accommodation is a 2-minute walk from basic shops ( supermarket, bakery, tobacco press, pharmacy, city center). You can also find restaurants in the immediate vicinity.\n\nAvailable: coffee maker, kettle, dishwasher, ceramic hob, oven, microwave ... and dishes in sufficient quantity for 8 people.\n\nThe apartment consists of 4 rooms (two with double beds and two with sofa beds), a bathroom (with bathtub), a separate toilet, a large kitchen, a small terrace adjoining the kitchen.\n\nA parking space is available in the courtyard of the building.\n\nPlease be aware that HousingAnywhere is an online booking platform. Therefore exchanging contact details and offering viewings is not possible. If you would like to reserve this accommodation, send me a booking request or a message and please mention your age and occupation. I look forward to meeting you !","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"4"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internet":{"value":"yes"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":